  "notes": "This is an advanced example that you can use to show the details of an event and select a date of the event based on the Flowbite Datepicker and select the time using a predefined set of time intervals based on checkbox elements.\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/themesberg/flowbite/blob/main/content/forms/timepicker.md",
